// A donut shop with a giant donut on the roof: roadside kitsch, built to be seen from the
// boulevard. A drive-thru window on its right side, the lane marked beside it. Kit format:
// crates/world/src/landmarks.rs and docs/adr/0007-landmark-kits.md. Kit frame, m: x across
// the lot (to the right seen from the road), y up, z toward the road; the lot spans x -15..15
// and z -32..0, parking in front of the shop.
Kit(
    id: "donut_shop",
    about: "A donut shop with a giant donut on its roof and a drive-thru window.",
    tone: Kitsch,
    lot: (30.0, 32.0),
    ground: Some("pad"),
    paints: [
        ("pad", (color: Pal(Asphalt), surface: Asphalt)),
        ("stripe", (color: Pal(PaintWhite), surface: Paint)),
        ("wall", (color: Pal(StuccoWhite), surface: Stucco)),
        ("trim", (color: Pal(MetalLight), surface: Metal)),
        ("glass", (color: Pal(Glass), surface: Glass, glow: Some((Pal(WindowWarm), Window)))),
        ("fascia", (color: Srgb(0xE58AAE), surface: Paint)),
        ("neon", (color: Srgb(0xFF8AC0), glow: Some((Srgb(0xFF4FA0), Neon)))),
        ("pole", (color: Pal(MetalDark), surface: Metal)),
        ("dough", (color: Srgb(0xC9884A), surface: Paint, glow: Some((Srgb(0x7A4A22), Window)))),
        ("icing", (color: Srgb(0xF4A2C4), surface: Paint, glow: Some((Srgb(0xA05A78), Window)))),
